{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12657","headline":"系乐府十二首 古遗叹 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 古遗叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古昔有遗叹，所叹何所爲。\n有国遗贤臣，万事爲冤悲。\n所遗非遗望，所遗非可遗。\n所遗非遗用，所遗在遗之。\n嗟嗟山海客，全独竟何辞。\n心非膏濡类，安得无不遗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}